  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for Country Partnership for Madagascar (2026-2030)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a formal letter dated 30 April 2024 (Reference N&#xb0;056-2024/MIC/DPP), the Government of Madagascar, through the Ministry of Industrialization and Commerce (MIC), officially requested UNIDO to support the formulation of a second Country Programme, covering 20 24-2028. UNIDO Director General favourably replied to that request through a formal letter dated 05 June 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
